    third_party/b70_gdn_xe2/. Directory licenses and individual Intel/Codeplay
    BSD notices are retained; the directory license does not replace them.
  - Intel SYCL-TLA (BSD-3-Clause), commit
    87f6850680a580654b9ea2c80dbc01aeb36ad231: optional external Xe2 header
    dependency and copied helpers with their source notices retained.
    Binary distributions using it must carry its LICENSE.txt.
